These rough players are also part of what real Italian soccer is about.

01:36.460 --> 01:40.140
Tsubasa, I'll survive in this club!

01:40.140 --> 01:41.300
Take this!

01:45.870 --> 01:49.060
Even while being out of balance because of these formidable defenders,

01:49.060 --> 01:52.540
Hyuga-kun's right foot hit the ball right in the center.

01:54.380 --> 01:58.540
He has now scored goals in all the scrimmages to date.

01:59.080 --> 02:01.410
Your percentage of shots on target is 100%.

02:01.410 --> 02:03.500
That's the undisputed best on the team.

02:06.140 --> 02:07.580
All right!

02:08.310 --> 02:10.210
Miss Matsumoto.

02:11.240 --> 02:13.620
Tell Hyuga when he gets back to the bench.

02:19.580 --> 02:21.580
Hyuga-kun!

02:22.940 --> 02:24.580
It looks like the coach has made up his mind.

02:25.810 --> 02:29.100
You'll start in the opening game.

02:32.560 --> 02:33.920
Yes!

02:40.180 --> 02:45.340
<b>Hyuga's Italian Debut</b>

02:40.180 --> 02:45.340
<b>Hyuga's Italian Debut</b>

02:46.140 --> 02:50.540
-Italy- Turin {Tori: I really like the look of this scene, especially the colours  It looks like a water colour painting.}

02:52.140 --> 02:56.540
FC Piemonte's Clubhouse

03:11.040 --> 03:13.960
The Italian League is finally about to start.

03:15.210 --> 03:17.100
You're still there, Hyuga?

03:18.200 --> 03:20.260
The bus is about to leave. Hurry up!

03:20.260 --> 03:21.470
Yes.

03:21.980 --> 03:24.970
All right! I'll be playing my first pro game!

03:47.060 --> 03:49.300
My professional debut,

03:50.400 --> 03:54.300
but that's not my goal. It's only the start!

03:58.420 --> 04:02.020
Piemonte's Home Stadium

04:12.900 --> 04:18.490
Kojiro, your struggle to be the world's best is finally about to start.

04:28.030 --> 04:29.730
Kojiro!

04:48.730 --> 04:51.220
I-It's not stopping!

04:53.420 --> 04:57.420
Is this the trembling of a warrior before a battle?

05:18.090 --> 05:21.220
We're up against a team who are good at defending.

05:21.220 --> 05:23.980
We have to hit them hard on the sides in order to break through.

05:25.350 --> 05:29.230
Especially the forwards, be careful of Jerome and Bianci marking.

05:29.230 --> 05:32.110
We're going to attack right from the start of the first half!

05:32.110 --> 05:33.500
Use the sides to get past them!

05:33.500 --> 05:34.670
Yes!

05:46.810 --> 05:49.970
Number one... Goalkeeper:

05:49.970 --> 05:52.060
Var Len... Fort!{alpha time these parts}

05:52.060 --> 05:54.210
Var Len... Fort!

05:56.680 --> 05:59.930
Number 21, midfielder...

06:05.950 --> 06:10.990
Number 26, midfielder... Hermes!

06:06.790 --> 06:07.580
Good luck!

06:13.110 --> 06:15.100
All right.

06:15.100 --> 06:18.250
Number 9, forward...

06:18.250 --> 06:20.100
Maroni... Francesco!

06:20.100 --> 06:23.050
Maroni... Francesco!

06:23.050 --> 06:26.260
Number 18, forward...

06:26.260 --> 06:28.220
Kojiro... Hyuga!

06:28.220 --> 06:30.340
Kojiro... Hyuga!

06:46.080 --> 06:47.720
There's our brother!

06:47.720 --> 06:49.340
He sure looks cool!

06:49.340 --> 06:53.340
Good people from Japan, are you able to witness these images?

06:53.340 --> 06:58.580
This is truly a brilliant achievement for Japanese soccer.

07:00.320 --> 07:05.250
"Wild Tiger" Hyuga Kojiro, the ace striker and the pride of Japan, is here!

07:06.510 --> 07:11.140
Dressed in a storied FC Piemonte jersey in this opening league game,

07:11.140 --> 07:15.140
Hyuga Kojiro is having his debut in the starting lineup!

07:16.020 --> 07:19.140
Be sure to show them what you've got, Hyuga-kun.

07:25.710 --> 07:28.940
Kojiro, show them your attacking soccer!

07:31.940 --> 07:36.670
You're on the biggest field in the world right now.

07:38.760 --> 07:44.450
You will use that eye, that eye of the tiger, to become the top striker in the world.

07:45.460 --> 07:49.670
That's the dream both of us have.

07:51.080 --> 07:55.340
I'll force the ball into the net of that goal!

07:56.130 --> 07:59.600
With that, I'll be one step closer to my dream!

08:00.690 --> 08:02.020
My dream...

08:02.020 --> 08:05.530
Tsubasa often said his dream was to play soccer.

08:06.570 --> 08:09.110
I can't express myself quite like he does,

08:10.420 --> 08:13.460
but I'll realize my dream, my way!

08:14.240 --> 08:18.030
I'm going to tear up this pitch for you too!

08:29.260 --> 08:33.220
-Spain- Barcelona

08:33.770 --> 08:37.170
Practice Field of FC Cataluña's B Team

08:39.690 --> 08:40.770
Too slow!

08:42.300 --> 08:45.140
The timing of your run is way too slow!

08:45.680 --> 08:50.350
You don't have to look this way once I've received the pass!

08:50.350 --> 08:52.140
Just run forward at full speed!

08:52.670 --> 08:54.140
Y-Yes...

08:54.140 --> 08:57.560
Okay, let's try that maneuver again.

08:57.560 --> 08:58.140
Yes!

09:01.680 --> 09:05.870
But can I really get that kind of timing down?

09:06.670 --> 09:09.140
Get it down that fast without screwing up the pass?

09:12.090 --> 09:12.940
All right, here I go!

09:15.630 --> 09:18.180
Will I reach the ball without looking at it?

09:24.500 --> 09:25.860
So fast!

09:28.260 --> 09:29.790
It's already here!

09:31.620 --> 09:34.620
And it's even a Green Cut Pass with a backspin!

09:36.110 --> 09:38.030
What an easy ball to receive!

09:38.790 --> 09:40.020
Hey, over here!

09:41.460 --> 09:44.140
He's already running to place himself in front of the goal!

09:47.240 --> 09:48.660
No good. It's too high!

09:48.660 --> 09:49.740
Darn it!

10:08.540 --> 10:12.260
Incredible! He used an overhead kick on my messed-up pass!

10:17.400 --> 10:22.260
As expected, Tsubasa Ohzora is certainly not a player who should be on the B team.

10:29.570 --> 10:32.290
The game will soon be under way!

10:32.290 --> 10:37.450
This will be the blazing debut of Hyuga Kojiro in Italy.

10:37.450 --> 10:43.930
The clubs, FC Piemonte and AC Emiria, are both members of Italy's Big Seven.

10:43.930 --> 10:48.780
And we're expecting a lot from Hyuga in this battle of titans.

10:54.800 --> 10:59.290
Emiria has one of the best defenders in the Italian League.

11:00.220 --> 11:03.780
Is that the <i>Catenaccio</i>, or "the iron lock", on the goal?

11:04.140 --> 11:07.820
I'll be sure to pry you guys apart and score!

11:11.330 --> 11:16.300
Hyuga-kun, you can do it! Give it your best!

11:21.620 --> 11:25.220
Hyuga kicks off the Italian League!

11:25.980 --> 11:29.900
Xavier, the leader of FC Piemonte, gets the ball.

11:29.900 --> 11:32.900
He's the one who's forming Piemonte's attacks.

11:32.900 --> 11:37.550
Xavier, from the French national team, is a top playmaker

11:37.550 --> 11:40.030
on the same level as Rivaul.

11:43.580 --> 11:46.850
Xavier keeps the ball even while being marked by two players!

11:47.540 --> 11:48.300
Now!

11:51.420 --> 11:55.100
Oh! He makes an overlap pass to Willem from Holland!

11:55.100 --> 11:56.260
He traps it!

11:56.260 --> 11:58.620
What a splendid pass from Xavier!

11:59.840 --> 12:04.620
Piemonte is playing at home and would like to open the score at all costs.

12:06.180 --> 12:08.390
Kojiro, now!

12:09.840 --> 12:14.030
Oh! Hyuga has shaken off his marker by sprinting!

12:11.780 --> 12:12.660
Hyuga!

12:14.030 --> 12:15.980
Can Hyuga get the pass?

12:15.980 --> 12:19.700
Hyuga, use every bit of your powers!

12:20.350 --> 12:23.900
I will pour every ounce of strength I have onto this field!

12:23.900 --> 12:27.590
But here come the fastest defenders in the Italian League!

12:27.590 --> 12:32.220
Jerome and Bianci both attack Hyuga while he is preparing to trap the ball!

12:32.220 --> 12:33.810
They want to take the ball?

12:34.500 --> 12:36.860
I won't let them!

12:38.860 --> 12:42.860
Oh! They literally formed the shape of a goal on top of Hyuga!

12:42.860 --> 12:45.060
T-These guys...

12:57.370 --> 13:01.590
Jerome and Bianci both attack Hyuga while he is preparing to trap the ball!

13:10.260 --> 13:14.260
Oh! They literally formed the shape of a goal on top of Hyuga!

13:17.700 --> 13:19.820
T-These guys...

13:19.820 --> 13:22.610
Hyuga is losing his balance!

13:27.390 --> 13:29.540
Francesco, please!

13:32.390 --> 13:37.500
Maroni Francesco, another forward, runs with perfect timing.

13:40.920 --> 13:44.130
It's in! Goal!

13:44.130 --> 13:46.650
Piemonte has already scored the first goal!

13:46.650 --> 13:50.730
Even while being out of balance, Hyuga managed to pass the ball!

13:50.730 --> 13:55.460
Hyuga's first involvement in Italy was to go for an offensive team play with a post play.

13:55.460 --> 13:58.380
He's not bad, this Kojiro!

13:59.590 --> 14:01.380
Of course he's not!

14:02.600 --> 14:03.620
All right!

14:03.620 --> 14:05.980
He did it!

14:06.390 --> 14:08.790
Our big brother, Kojiro, just got an assist!

14:11.470 --> 14:15.760
Oh, what's this? It's been judged offside.

14:15.760 --> 14:19.410
What's this!? Maroni's goal has been refused.

14:19.410 --> 14:21.870
What!? Not a goal, you say!?

14:23.200 --> 14:26.040
The crowd is booing.

14:30.050 --> 14:31.640
That was offside?

14:31.640 --> 14:32.700
No way...

14:33.870 --> 14:37.500
Xavier runs to interrupt Maroni who's complaining to the side referee.

14:37.980 --> 14:39.460
What in the world?

14:41.260 --> 14:44.700
Carlo, Hyuga's bodily imbalance is too much of a handicap.

14:44.700 --> 14:48.960
Mazz, Hyuga does have an unbalanced body,

14:49.470 --> 14:52.190
but he's got the instincts.

14:53.580 --> 14:58.220
Even though he was off balance, he correctly received the ball.

14:58.810 --> 15:03.020
The maneuvering you just saw is second nature to him.

15:03.020 --> 15:05.540
That's a big weapon Hyuga's got.

15:09.060 --> 15:12.360
Damn, that definitely wasn't offside.

15:12.360 --> 15:13.060
You're right.

15:13.730 --> 15:17.710
Hyuga, that was a nice ball! We'll score the next time!

15:17.710 --> 15:18.820
All right!

15:26.870 --> 15:29.870
The shot from Maroni won't count as a goal.

15:29.870 --> 15:33.500
AC Emiria gets the ball with a free kick after that offside call.

15:41.990 --> 15:43.650
Oh, he couldn't trap it!

15:43.650 --> 15:45.210
Piemonte takes the ball back!

15:47.110 --> 15:49.980
My physical condition is good. My body feels light.

15:50.850 --> 15:52.980
Next up: using my right foot to shoot...

15:54.360 --> 15:55.700
and score!

15:55.700 --> 16:00.270
Damn it! I let my guard down a bit, thinking he was a novice.

16:00.270 --> 16:03.710
I'll go at him much harder from now on!

16:04.450 --> 16:08.220
That's the last time you'll pull off that play!

16:09.620 --> 16:12.940
My right foot is itching!

16:14.140 --> 16:17.400
It wants to shoot as fast as possible!

16:18.240 --> 16:22.500
It moans and begs me to let it score a goal!

16:24.750 --> 16:26.830
I've got only one target:

16:28.700 --> 16:30.980
to score a goal on Emiria!

16:35.420 --> 16:36.780
Here's Willem!

16:36.780 --> 16:40.020
Go, Hyuga! Run straight for it!

16:40.020 --> 16:43.030
Has Willem created a new opportunity to attack?

16:43.030 --> 16:46.720
Hyuga has the timing down, but will it work this time?

16:49.780 --> 16:56.090
Oh, he doesn't get through! Jerome, Emiria's defender, charged Hyuga! {Tori: More blind referees?}

16:57.640 --> 16:59.980
That elbow blow was on purpose!

17:02.620 --> 17:07.370
This isn't the time to get angry. I've got better things to do. {Tori:  I like the way he thinks here.  Keeps his anger in check for the good of the team.  No yellow cards for Hyuga, but that other guy should've got one!}

17:14.420 --> 17:16.670
That was close for Hyuga.

17:16.670 --> 17:20.290
Well, against Jerome, I guess it had to go like that.

17:20.290 --> 17:26.180
Nah, a forward from FC Piemonte should've held up against that.

17:27.300 --> 17:31.300
Over there, Xavier. Go for it!

17:36.170 --> 17:36.860
Speed,

17:40.080 --> 17:40.860
power,

17:42.390 --> 17:43.180
technique,

17:45.400 --> 17:46.660
toughness.

17:49.370 --> 17:54.280
You don't survive in this league without all of those qualities.

18:12.340 --> 18:16.170
Willem breaks through two players and continues to go forward by dribbling up the side!

18:20.020 --> 18:26.660
I'm here by accident only because Lamberto and Komasevic are injured.

18:27.820 --> 18:34.200
And on the bench, elite strikers from around the world want to take my place.

18:36.500 --> 18:38.260
I have to score!

18:40.870 --> 18:45.060
It's by scoring that I can keep my place!

18:46.240 --> 18:49.060
Attack, Kojiro!

18:49.060 --> 18:51.140
Your chance will come for sure!

18:51.140 --> 18:55.240
No, exploit the defender's weaknesses in order to make those chances.

18:55.240 --> 18:58.060
That's always been your way of playing soccer.

18:59.540 --> 19:04.670
Piemonte has been controlling the ball more, but hasn't had a lot of chances to score.

19:04.670 --> 19:07.100
How will Piemonte attack?

19:10.540 --> 19:12.860
Xavier, the playmaker, has the ball again.

19:30.370 --> 19:34.740
I don't know everything about Xavier's playing style,

19:34.740 --> 19:37.860
but I know Ohzora Tsubasa's!

19:38.650 --> 19:40.260
As his opponent,

19:42.530 --> 19:47.660
and teammate, I've been playing with the best playmaker in the world:

19:49.660 --> 19:51.150
Ohzora Tsubasa.

19:59.910 --> 20:04.370
And Xavier is also one of the best playmakers in the world.

20:08.450 --> 20:11.780
If I imagine where Tsubasa would pass me the ball,

20:12.690 --> 20:16.200
I'm sure Xavier will pass the ball right there, too.

20:32.660 --> 20:35.180
Hyuga gets rid of his mark with a running feint!

20:38.580 --> 20:39.770
What!?

20:55.260 --> 20:56.980
As I expected from Xavier!

20:57.450 --> 20:59.080
All right! This one's mine!

21:01.640 --> 21:03.980
Hyuga has created himself a great chance!

21:03.980 --> 21:06.710
Now he only has to shoot!

21:07.930 --> 21:10.340
Damn it! I won't let you!

21:18.680 --> 21:21.020
Hyuga jumps in order to avoid the tackle!

21:21.820 --> 21:23.820
The powerful tackle of Jerome misses its target!

21:31.390 --> 21:32.740
Now's the moment!

21:42.820 --> 21:44.020
Eat this!

